    "The balanced pick: good Vietnamese at a quick pace.": {
      "localizations": {
        "lo": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ທາງເລືອກທີ່ສົມດຸນ: ພາສາຫວຽດນາມດີ ແຖມຍັງໄວ"
